                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you can accept that this is a game where managing your emotional state is as important as managing your money and fuel, recognize some of the early \"forced\" choices are part of the tutorial as well as part of presenting the core themes of the game, you'll find an engaging story with a variety of emotional tone and highly engaging, well written characters.\r\n\r\nThis isn't a classic Japanese Visual Novel with two dozen different endings - it has a specific story it wants to tell, but it's a good story, and presented lavishly. I'd really love to see more games engage with its themes about emotions and how they affect relationships and communication.\r\n\r\nRecommend it to your therapist to impress them. ;)",
